{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالذَّارِيَاتِ","d":"wal-dhāriyāti","e":"By those scattering"},{"c":"ذَرْوًا","d":"dharwan","e":"dispersing"}],"a":{"g":"By those [winds] scattering [dust] dispersing"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْحَامِلَاتِ","d":"fal-ḥāmilāti","e":"And those carrying"},{"c":"وِقْرًا","d":"wiq'ran","e":"a load"}],"a":{"g":"And those [clouds] carrying a load [of water]"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْجَارِيَاتِ","d":"fal-jāriyāti","e":"And those sailing"},{"c":"يُسْرًا","d":"yus'ran","e":"(with) ease"}],"a":{"g":"And those [ships] sailing with ease"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْمُقَسِّمَاتِ","d":"fal-muqasimāti","e":"And those distributing"},{"c":"أَمْرًا","d":"amran","e":"Command"}],"a":{"g":"And those [angels] apportioning [each] matter,"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Indeed what"},{"c":"تُوعَدُونَ","d":"tūʿadūna","e":"you are promised"},{"c":"لَصَادِقٌ","d":"laṣādiqun","e":"(is) surely true"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, what you are promised is true."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"الدِّينَ","d":"l-dīna","e":"the Judgment"},{"c":"لَوَاقِعٌ","d":"lawāqiʿun","e":"(is) surely to occur"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, the recompense is to occur."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَالسَّمَاءِ","d":"wal-samāi","e":"By the heaven"},{"c":"ذَاتِ","d":"dhāti","e":"full of"},{"c":"الْحُبُكِ","d":"l-ḥubuki","e":"pathways"}],"a":{"g":"By the heaven containing pathways,"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّكُمْ","d":"innakum","e":"Indeed you"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"(are) surely in"},{"c":"قَوْلٍ","d":"qawlin","e":"a speech"},{"c":"مُخْتَلِفٍ","d":"mukh'talifin","e":"differing"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, you are in differing speech."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"يُؤْفَكُ","d":"yu'faku","e":"Deluded away"},{"c":"عَنْهُ","d":"ʿanhu","e":"from it"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(is he) who"},{"c":"أُفِكَ","d":"ufika","e":"is deluded"}],"a":{"g":"Deluded away from the Qur'an is he who is deluded."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"قُتِلَ","d":"qutila","e":"Cursed be"},{"c":"الْخَرَّاصُونَ","d":"l-kharāṣūna","e":"the liars"}],"a":{"g":"Destroyed are the falsifiers"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Those who"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"غَمْرَةٍ","d":"ghamratin","e":"flood"},{"c":"سَاهُونَ","d":"sāhūna","e":"(of) heedlessness"}],"a":{"g":"Who are within a flood [of confusion] and heedless."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"يَسْءَلُونَ","d":"yasalūna","e":"They ask"},{"c":"أَيَّانَ","d":"ayyāna","e":"When"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is the) Day"},{"c":"الدِّينِ","d":"l-dīni","e":"(of) Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"They ask, \"When is the Day of Recompense?\""}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"A Day"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"over"},{"c":"النَّارِ","d":"l-nāri","e":"the Fire"},{"c":"يُفْتَنُونَ","d":"yuf'tanūna","e":"will be tried"}],"a":{"g":"[It is] the Day they will be tormented over the Fire"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"ذُوقُوا","d":"dhūqū","e":"Taste"},{"c":"فِتْنَتَكُمْ","d":"fit'natakum","e":"your trial"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you were"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"for it"},{"c":"تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ","d":"tastaʿjilūna","e":"seeking to hasten"}],"a":{"g":"[And will be told], \"Taste your torment. This is that for which you were impatient.\""}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"l-mutaqīna","e":"the righteous"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(will be) in"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"Gardens"},{"c":"وَعُيُونٍ","d":"waʿuyūnin","e":"and springs"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the righteous will be among gardens and springs,"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"ءَاخِذِينَ","d":"ākhidhīna","e":"Taking"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"ءَاتَاهُمْ","d":"ātāhum","e":"(their Lord) has given them"},{"c":"رَبُّهُمْ","d":"rabbuhum","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"Indeed, they"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"were"},{"c":"قَبْلَ","d":"qabla","e":"before"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"مُحْسِنِينَ","d":"muḥ'sinīna","e":"good-doers"}],"a":{"g":"Accepting what their Lord has given them. Indeed, they were before that doers of good."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"They used (to)"},{"c":"قَلِيلًا","d":"qalīlan","e":"little"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"اللَّيْلِ","d":"al-layli","e":"the night"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"[what]"},{"c":"يَهْجَعُونَ","d":"yahjaʿūna","e":"sleep"}],"a":{"g":"They used to sleep but little of the night,"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"وَبِالْأَسْحَارِ","d":"wabil-asḥāri","e":"And in the hours before dawn"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"يَسْتَغْفِرُونَ","d":"yastaghfirūna","e":"would ask forgiveness"}],"a":{"g":"And in the hours before dawn they would ask forgiveness,"}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"And in"},{"c":"أَمْوَالِهِمْ","d":"amwālihim","e":"their wealth"},{"c":"حَقٌّ","d":"ḥaqqun","e":"(was the) right"},{"c":"لِلسَّائِلِ","d":"lilssāili","e":"(of) those who asked"},{"c":"وَالْمَحْرُومِ","d":"wal-maḥrūmi","e":"and the deprived"}],"a":{"g":"And from their properties was [given] the right of the [needy] petitioner and the deprived."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"And in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"ءَايَاتٌ","d":"āyātun","e":"(are) signs"},{"c":"لِلْمُوقِنِينَ","d":"lil'mūqinīna","e":"for those who are certain"}],"a":{"g":"And on the earth are signs for the certain [in faith]"}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"And in"},{"c":"أَنْفُسِكُمْ","d":"anfusikum","e":"yourselves"},{"c":"أَفَلَا","d":"afalā","e":"Then will not"},{"c":"تُبْصِرُونَ","d":"tub'ṣirūna","e":"you see"}],"a":{"g":"And in yourselves. Then will you not see?"}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"And in"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"رِزْقُكُمْ","d":"riz'qukum","e":"(is) your provision"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and what"},{"c":"تُوعَدُونَ","d":"tūʿadūna","e":"you are promised"}],"a":{"g":"And in the heaven is your provision and whatever you are promised."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"فَوَرَبِّ","d":"fawarabbi","e":"Then by (the) Lord"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"(of) the heaven"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"indeed it"},{"c":"لَحَقٌّ","d":"laḥaqqun","e":"(is) surely (the) truth"},{"c":"مِثْلَ","d":"mith'la","e":"(just) as"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"[what]"},{"c":"أَنَّكُمْ","d":"annakum","e":"you"},{"c":"تَنْطِقُونَ","d":"tanṭiqūna","e":"speak"}],"a":{"g":"Then by the Lord of the heaven and earth, indeed, it is truth - just as [sure as] it is that you are speaking."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Has"},{"c":"أَتَىكَ","d":"atāka","e":"reached you"},{"c":"حَدِيثُ","d":"ḥadīthu","e":"(the) narration"},{"c":"ضَيْفِ","d":"ḍayfi","e":"(of the) guests"},{"c":"إِبْرَاهِيمَ","d":"ib'rāhīma","e":"(of) Ibrahim"},{"c":"الْمُكْرَمِينَ","d":"l-muk'ramīna","e":"the honored"}],"a":{"g":"Has there reached you the story of the honored guests of Abraham? -"}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"When"},{"c":"دَخَلُوا","d":"dakhalū","e":"they entered"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"upon him"},{"c":"فَقَالُوا","d":"faqālū","e":"and said"},{"c":"سَلَامًا","d":"salāman","e":"Peace"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"سَلَامٌ","d":"salāmun","e":"Peace"},{"c":"قَوْمٌ","d":"qawmun","e":"a people"},{"c":"مُنْكَرُونَ","d":"munkarūna","e":"unknown"}],"a":{"g":"When they entered upon him and said, \"[We greet you with] peace.\" He answered, \"[And upon you] peace, [you are] a people unknown."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"فَرَاغَ","d":"farāgha","e":"Then he went"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"أَهْلِهِ","d":"ahlihi","e":"his household"},{"c":"فَجَاءَ","d":"fajāa","e":"and came"},{"c":"بِعِجْلٍ","d":"biʿij'lin","e":"with a calf"},{"c":"سَمِينٍ","d":"samīnin","e":"fat"}],"a":{"g":"Then he went to his family and came with a fat [roasted] calf"}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"فَقَرَّبَهُ","d":"faqarrabahu","e":"And he placed it near"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِمْ","d":"ilayhim","e":"[to] them"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"he said"},{"c":"أَلَا","d":"alā","e":"Will not"},{"c":"تَأْكُلُونَ","d":"takulūna","e":"you eat"}],"a":{"g":"And placed it near them; he said, \"Will you not eat?\""}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَوْجَسَ","d":"fa-awjasa","e":"Then he felt"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"from them"},{"c":"خِيفَةً","d":"khīfatan","e":"a fear"},{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Do) not"},{"c":"تَخَفْ","d":"takhaf","e":"fear"},{"c":"وَبَشَّرُوهُ","d":"wabasharūhu","e":"and they gave him glad tidings"},{"c":"بِغُلَامٍ","d":"bighulāmin","e":"of a son"},{"c":"عَلِيمٍ","d":"ʿalīmin","e":"learned"}],"a":{"g":"And he felt from them apprehension. They said, \"Fear not,\" and gave him good tidings of a learned boy."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَقْبَلَتِ","d":"fa-aqbalati","e":"Then came forward"},{"c":"امْرَأَتُهُ","d":"im'ra-atuhu","e":"his wife"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"with"},{"c":"صَرَّةٍ","d":"ṣarratin","e":"a loud voice"},{"c":"فَصَكَّتْ","d":"faṣakkat","e":"and struck"},{"c":"وَجْهَهَا","d":"wajhahā","e":"her face"},{"c":"وَقَالَتْ","d":"waqālat","e":"and she said"},{"c":"عَجُوزٌ","d":"ʿajūzun","e":"An old woman"},{"c":"عَقِيمٌ","d":"ʿaqīmun","e":"barren!"}],"a":{"g":"And his wife approached with a cry [of alarm] and struck her face and said, \"[I am] a barren old woman!\""}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"كَذَلِكِ","d":"kadhāliki","e":"Thus"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"said"},{"c":"رَبُّكِ","d":"rabbuki","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"[He]"},{"c":"الْحَكِيمُ","d":"l-ḥakīmu","e":"(is) the All-Wise"},{"c":"الْعَلِيمُ","d":"l-ʿalīmu","e":"the All-Knower"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"Thus has said your Lord; indeed, He is the Wise, the Knowing.\""}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"Then what"},{"c":"خَطْبُكُمْ","d":"khaṭbukum","e":"(is) your mission"},{"c":"أَيُّهَا","d":"ayyuhā","e":"O messengers"},{"c":"الْمُرْسَلُونَ","d":"l-mur'salūna","e":"O messengers"}],"a":{"g":"[Abraham] said, \"Then what is your business [here], O messengers?\""}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"أُرْسِلْنَا","d":"ur'sil'nā","e":"[we] have been sent"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"قَوْمٍ","d":"qawmin","e":"a people"},{"c":"مُجْرِمِينَ","d":"muj'rimīna","e":"criminal"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"Indeed, we have been sent to a people of criminals"}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"لِنُرْسِلَ","d":"linur'sila","e":"That we may send down"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"upon them"},{"c":"حِجَارَةً","d":"ḥijāratan","e":"stones"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"طِينٍ","d":"ṭīnin","e":"clay"}],"a":{"g":"To send down upon them stones of clay,"}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"مُسَوَّمَةً","d":"musawwamatan","e":"Marked"},{"c":"عِنْدَ","d":"ʿinda","e":"by your Lord"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"by your Lord"},{"c":"لِلْمُسْرِفِينَ","d":"lil'mus'rifīna","e":"for the transgressors"}],"a":{"g":"Marked in the presence of your Lord for the transgressors.\""}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَخْرَجْنَا","d":"fa-akhrajnā","e":"Then We brought out"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(those) who"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"were"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْمُؤْمِنِينَ","d":"l-mu'minīna","e":"the believers"}],"a":{"g":"So We brought out whoever was in the cities of the believers."}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"But not"},{"c":"وَجَدْنَا","d":"wajadnā","e":"We found"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"غَيْرَ","d":"ghayra","e":"other than"},{"c":"بَيْتٍ","d":"baytin","e":"a house"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْمُسْلِمِينَ","d":"l-mus'limīna","e":"the Muslims"}],"a":{"g":"And We found not within them other than a [single] house of Muslims."}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"وَتَرَكْنَا","d":"wataraknā","e":"And We left"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"ءَايَةً","d":"āyatan","e":"a Sign"},{"c":"لِلَّذِينَ","d":"lilladhīna","e":"for those who"},{"c":"يَخَافُونَ","d":"yakhāfūna","e":"fear"},{"c":"الْعَذَابَ","d":"l-ʿadhāba","e":"the punishment"},{"c":"الْأَلِيمَ","d":"l-alīma","e":"the painful"}],"a":{"g":"And We left therein a sign for those who fear the painful punishment."}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"And in"},{"c":"مُوسَى","d":"mūsā","e":"Musa"},{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"when"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَاهُ","d":"arsalnāhu","e":"We sent him"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"فِرْعَوْنَ","d":"fir'ʿawna","e":"Firaun"},{"c":"بِسُلْطَانٍ","d":"bisul'ṭānin","e":"with an authority"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"And in Moses [was a sign], when We sent him to Pharaoh with clear authority."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"فَتَوَلَّى","d":"fatawallā","e":"But he turned away"},{"c":"بِرُكْنِهِ","d":"biruk'nihi","e":"with his supporters"},{"c":"وَقَالَ","d":"waqāla","e":"and said"},{"c":"سَاحِرٌ","d":"sāḥirun","e":"A magician"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"مَجْنُونٌ","d":"majnūnun","e":"a madman"}],"a":{"g":"But he turned away with his supporters and said,\" A magician or a madman.\""}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَخَذْنَاهُ","d":"fa-akhadhnāhu","e":"So We took him"},{"c":"وَجُنُودَهُ","d":"wajunūdahu","e":"and his hosts"},{"c":"فَنَبَذْنَاهُمْ","d":"fanabadhnāhum","e":"and threw them"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"into"},{"c":"الْيَمِّ","d":"l-yami","e":"the sea"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"while he"},{"c":"مُلِيمٌ","d":"mulīmun","e":"(was) blameworthy"}],"a":{"g":"So We took him and his soldiers and cast them into the sea, and he was blameworthy."}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"And in"},{"c":"عَادٍ","d":"ʿādin","e":"Aad"},{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"when"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"We sent"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمُ","d":"ʿalayhimu","e":"against them"},{"c":"الرِّيحَ","d":"l-rīḥa","e":"the wind"},{"c":"الْعَقِيمَ","d":"l-ʿaqīma","e":"the barren"}],"a":{"g":"And in 'Aad [was a sign], when We sent against them the barren wind."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"تَذَرُ","d":"tadharu","e":"it left"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"أَتَتْ","d":"atat","e":"it came"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"upon it"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"جَعَلَتْهُ","d":"jaʿalathu","e":"it made it"},{"c":"كَالرَّمِيمِ","d":"kal-ramīmi","e":"like disintegrated ruins"}],"a":{"g":"It left nothing of what it came upon but that it made it like disintegrated ruins."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"And in"},{"c":"ثَمُودَ","d":"thamūda","e":"Thamud"},{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"when"},{"c":"قِيلَ","d":"qīla","e":"was said"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"to them"},{"c":"تَمَتَّعُوا","d":"tamattaʿū","e":"Enjoy (yourselves)"},{"c":"حَتَّى","d":"ḥattā","e":"for"},{"c":"حِينٍ","d":"ḥīnin","e":"a time"}],"a":{"g":"And in Thamud, when it was said to them, \"Enjoy yourselves for a time.\""}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"فَعَتَوْا","d":"faʿataw","e":"But they rebelled"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"against"},{"c":"أَمْرِ","d":"amri","e":"(the) Command"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"(of) their Lord"},{"c":"فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ","d":"fa-akhadhathumu","e":"so seized them"},{"c":"الصَّاعِقَةُ","d":"l-ṣāʿiqatu","e":"the thunderbolt"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"while they"},{"c":"يَنْظُرُونَ","d":"yanẓurūna","e":"were looking"}],"a":{"g":"But they were insolent toward the command of their Lord, so the thunderbolt seized them while they were looking on."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"Then not"},{"c":"اسْتَطَاعُوا","d":"is'taṭāʿū","e":"they were able"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"to"},{"c":"قِيَامٍ","d":"qiyāmin","e":"stand"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they could"},{"c":"مُنْتَصِرِينَ","d":"muntaṣirīna","e":"help themselves"}],"a":{"g":"And they were unable to arise, nor could they defend themselves."}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَوْمَ","d":"waqawma","e":"And (the) people"},{"c":"نُوحٍ","d":"nūḥin","e":"(of) Nuh"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before"},{"c":"قَبْلُ","d":"qablu","e":"before"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"indeed, they"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"were"},{"c":"قَوْمًا","d":"qawman","e":"a people"},{"c":"فَاسِقِينَ","d":"fāsiqīna","e":"defiantly disobedient"}],"a":{"g":"And [We destroyed] the people of Noah before; indeed, they were a people defiantly disobedient."}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"وَالسَّمَاءَ","d":"wal-samāa","e":"And the Heaven"},{"c":"بَنَيْنَاهَا","d":"banaynāhā","e":"We constructed it"},{"c":"بِأَيْدٍ","d":"bi-aydin","e":"with strength"},{"c":"وَإِنَّا","d":"wa-innā","e":"and indeed We"},{"c":"لَمُوسِعُونَ","d":"lamūsiʿūna","e":"(are) surely (its) Expanders"}],"a":{"g":"And the heaven We constructed with strength, and indeed, We are [its] expander."}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"And the earth"},{"c":"فَرَشْنَاهَا","d":"farashnāhā","e":"We have spread it"},{"c":"فَنِعْمَ","d":"faniʿ'ma","e":"how excellent"},{"c":"الْمَاهِدُونَ","d":"l-māhidūna","e":"(are) the Spreaders"}],"a":{"g":"And the earth We have spread out, and excellent is the preparer."}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And of"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"We have created"},{"c":"زَوْجَيْنِ","d":"zawjayni","e":"pairs"},{"c":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","d":"laʿallakum","e":"so that you may"},{"c":"تَذَكَّرُونَ","d":"tadhakkarūna","e":"remember"}],"a":{"g":"And of all things We created two mates; perhaps you will remember."}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"فَفِرُّوا","d":"fafirrū","e":"So flee"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"indeed I am"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"to you"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"from Him"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"So flee to Allah. Indeed, I am to you from Him a clear warner."}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And (do) not"},{"c":"تَجْعَلُوا","d":"tajʿalū","e":"make"},{"c":"مَعَ","d":"maʿa","e":"with"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"إِلَهًا","d":"ilāhan","e":"god"},{"c":"ءَاخَرَ","d":"ākhara","e":"another"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I am"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"to you"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"from Him"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"And do not make [as equal] with Allah another deity. Indeed, I am to you from Him a clear warner."}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Likewise"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"أَتَى","d":"atā","e":"came"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(to) those"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before them"},{"c":"قَبْلِهِمْ","d":"qablihim","e":"before them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"رَسُولٍ","d":"rasūlin","e":"Messenger"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"they said"},{"c":"سَاحِرٌ","d":"sāḥirun","e":"A magician"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"مَجْنُونٌ","d":"majnūnun","e":"a madman"}],"a":{"g":"Similarly, there came not to those before them any messenger except that they said, \"A magician or a madman.\""}},"53":{"w":[{"c":"أَتَوَاصَوْا","d":"atawāṣaw","e":"Have they transmitted it to them"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"Have they transmitted it to them"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"قَوْمٌ","d":"qawmun","e":"(are) a people"},{"c":"طَاغُونَ","d":"ṭāghūna","e":"transgressing"}],"a":{"g":"Did they suggest it to them? Rather, they [themselves] are a transgressing people."}},"54":{"w":[{"c":"فَتَوَلَّ","d":"fatawalla","e":"So turn away"},{"c":"عَنْهُمْ","d":"ʿanhum","e":"from them"},{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"for not"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"you"},{"c":"بِمَلُومٍ","d":"bimalūmin","e":"(are) to be blamed"}],"a":{"g":"So leave them, [O Muhammad], for you are not to be blamed."}},"55":{"w":[{"c":"وَذَكِّرْ","d":"wadhakkir","e":"And remind"},{"c":"فَإِنَّ","d":"fa-inna","e":"for indeed"},{"c":"الذِّكْرَى","d":"l-dhik'rā","e":"the reminder"},{"c":"تَنْفَعُ","d":"tanfaʿu","e":"benefits"},{"c":"الْمُؤْمِنِينَ","d":"l-mu'minīna","e":"the believers"}],"a":{"g":"And remind, for indeed, the reminder benefits the believers."}},"56":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"خَلَقْتُ","d":"khalaqtu","e":"I have created"},{"c":"الْجِنَّ","d":"l-jina","e":"the jinn"},{"c":"وَالْإِنْسَ","d":"wal-insa","e":"and the mankind"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"لِيَعْبُدُونِ","d":"liyaʿbudūni","e":"that they worship Me"}],"a":{"g":"And I did not create the jinn and mankind except to worship Me."}},"57":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"أُرِيدُ","d":"urīdu","e":"I want"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"from them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"رِزْقٍ","d":"riz'qin","e":"provision"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"أُرِيدُ","d":"urīdu","e":"I want"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"يُطْعِمُونِ","d":"yuṭ'ʿimūni","e":"they (should) feed Me"}],"a":{"g":"I do not want from them any provision, nor do I want them to feed Me."}},"58":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"الرَّزَّاقُ","d":"l-razāqu","e":"(is) the All-Provider"},{"c":"ذُو","d":"dhū","e":"Possessor"},{"c":"الْقُوَّةِ","d":"l-quwati","e":"(of) Power"},{"c":"الْمَتِينُ","d":"l-matīnu","e":"the Strong"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, it is Allah who is the [continual] Provider, the firm possessor of strength."}},"59":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِنَّ","d":"fa-inna","e":"So indeed"},{"c":"لِلَّذِينَ","d":"lilladhīna","e":"for those who"},{"c":"ظَلَمُوا","d":"ẓalamū","e":"do wrong"},{"c":"ذَنُوبًا","d":"dhanūban","e":"(is) a portion"},{"c":"مِثْلَ","d":"mith'la","e":"like"},{"c":"ذَنُوبِ","d":"dhanūbi","e":"(the) portion"},{"c":"أَصْحَابِهِمْ","d":"aṣḥābihim","e":"(of) their companions"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"so let them not ask Me to hasten"},{"c":"يَسْتَعْجِلُونِ","d":"yastaʿjilūni","e":"so let them not ask Me to hasten"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, for those who have wronged is a portion [of punishment] like the portion of their predecessors, so let them not impatiently urge Me."}},"60":{"w":[{"c":"فَوَيْلٌ","d":"fawaylun","e":"Then woe"},{"c":"لِلَّذِينَ","d":"lilladhīna","e":"to those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"يَوْمِهِمُ","d":"yawmihimu","e":"their Day"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"which"},{"c":"يُوعَدُونَ","d":"yūʿadūna","e":"they are promised"}],"a":{"g":"And woe to those who have disbelieved from their Day which they are promised."}}}